<title>USA: IDT Q3 shr profit $0.01 vs loss $0.25.</title>
<headline>IDT Q3 shr profit $0.01 vs loss $0.25.</headline>
<dateline>HACKENSACK, N.J. 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period ended April 30</p>
<p>			   1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.01     loss	 $0.25</p>
<p> Net profit		   161     loss	 4,600</p>
<p> Revs			34,500		   18,200</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>	   9 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.23     loss	 $0.65</p>
<p> Net loss		   4,700     loss	11,200</p>
<p> Revs			94,200		   34,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs		     n/a			n/a</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: The full company name is IDT Corp.</p>
<p>The company said Q3 was its first profitable quarter as a public company.</p>
<p>Revenues from the company's telecommunication's operations grew 131 percent to $26.1 million from $11.3 million a year ago.</p>
